  "notes": "Modified cash basis governmental funds; business-type activities accrual basis (Statement of Activities p2-3 column ties to the proprietary statement p7: expenses 264,651, charges 236,268, misc 651, interest 53). Governmental lines from Total Governmental Funds (p5); loan proceeds 45,534 printed inside Total revenues kept as a receipt line (Loan Proceeds). Contributions and grants 62,803 split using the p10 General Fund breakdown (Grants 5,192 + Contributions 57,611 = 62,803 exactly). Fund balance roll-forward used (298,405 -> 321,495); beginning cash not printed. ending_cash = Cash and cash equivalents 720 only (p4); county treasurer cash 290,313 and CDs 30,462 are separate lines. Balance sheet from government-wide Statement of Net Position (capital assets and debt, so not the funds balance sheet). Detail: General Fund departmental combining statement (p10) only; the combined all-governmental-funds Budgetary Comparison Schedule (p9) is not recorded (overlaps the General Fund and is not by fund); no Street/CDBG or utility budget schedules in the trim. Business-type receipts total = operating 236,919 + interest 53 (no single printed total). Read pages 1-10 of 10"
